OL,3,GNEWSASite investigated over medical
OL,4,Awaste dumping claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FLand that borders a protected nature
OL,7,Fsite is being investigated over claims
OL,8,Fit is being used as an illegal site to
OL,9,Fdump medical waste.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said it was
OL,12,Finvestigating the site off Mill Lane,
OL,13,Fnear Wadborough, in Worcestershire. The
OL,14,Fland is near Great Blaythorn Meadow,
OL,15,Fwhich is a Site of Special Scientific
OL,16,FInterest (SSSI).
OL,18,FA resident in the area, who asked not
OL,19,Fto be named, told the BBC a muck
OL,20,Fspreader, which are normally used to
OL,21,Fdistribute farmyard manure, had been
OL,22,Fused to spread medical waste.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
